# ── Agent context — local dev only, never committed ──────────────────
# CLAUDE.md and .claude/ carry this repo's agent instructions, skills,
# hooks and settings. They are deliberately untracked so `main` never
# ships them; keep your own local copies for development.
#
# Exception: the SessionStart hook and its settings are tracked, so
# Claude Code on the web can install dependencies without a manual step.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/*
